# Lead Capture & AI Scoring System

A professional lead intake system with AI scoring and automation triggers, built as part of a developer assignment.

## Features

- **Front-End**: React form with Bootstrap styling, validation, loading spinner, and user feedback.
- **Back-End**: Node.js with Express, OpenAI integration for lead scoring, SQLite database with Sequelize.
- **Automation**: Email notifications and webhook for high-quality leads.
- **Error Handling**: Custom error handling with middleware.
- **Input Validation**: Back-end validation with `express-validator`.

## Prerequisites

- Node.js (v16 or higher)
- OpenAI API key
- Gmail account for email notifications (or SMTP service)
- Webhook testing service (e.g., webhook.site)

## Setup Instructions

### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-repo/lead-capture-system.git
cd lead-capture-system

cd backend
npm install
npm start


.env

OPENAI_API_KEY=
EMAIL_USER=
EMAIL_PASS=
WEBHOOK_URL=

cd frontend
npm install
npm start
```
